    <briefdescription>
<para>Adds physics properties to an entity. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Entities with this component are affected by gravity and can participate in collision detection and resolution. The velocity is updated each frame by the physics system.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>This component is used for both the player and enemies. </para>
</simplesect>
